  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Gaining psionic focus comes second nature to you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Psionic Meditation.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You no longer provoke attacks of opportunity when meditating to gain psionic focus. Should you have multiple psionic foci, such as from Deep Focus, you regain any psionic focus you are not currently maintaining anytime you meditate to gain psionic focus. In addition, you can expend a use of mythic power to regain your psionic focus as a free action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
